WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome back.
-Hello! Thank you.

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:04.004
I love coming to your show.
-I love having you here.

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:07.073
And I also love that "The Voice"
is coming back.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.508 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
♪♪ La Voix ♪♪

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Both laugh ]
-"La Voix," that's right.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:10.810 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I can't not do it.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.380
-So, this is your second season.
You won your first season.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did.
-Did you get to brag it up?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:17.517 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.517 --> 00:00:20.053
-It was one of those things --
Well, Blake and I made a bet.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:23.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I won, he had to call me
Queen Kelly Clarkson.

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:27.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if he won, I'd have
to shut up for five minutes.

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:29.095 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:30.363 size:81% position:41% line:92%
So, I'm still talking.

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:31.965 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
No, but so --

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:35.502
I mean, I had to perform
at his bar to get him to say it,

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:36.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
but, yeah.
-Really?

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-So in order for him

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
to call you Queen,
you had to, like, go do a gig.

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:41.141 size:88% position:44%
-I had to go to Ole Red.
That's what I had to do.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:43.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I was willing to do it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:45.612 size:88% position:44%
-Hopefully you got some
nice grainy iPhone video

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:48.114 align:start size:94% position:6%
of him calling you Queen.
-I do have grainy --

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.516 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They just released
a clip online,

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.219 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think either
yesterday or today,

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:56.489
of this wonderful 13-year-old...
-13, yeah.

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...who's got this
incredibly powerful voice.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:00.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And it seemed like,

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
based on the way
you guys were talking,

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:03.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
and this will obviously
be in the show

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:05.899
when it premieres, but you guys
were all blown away.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:08.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were.
We all kind of took our time

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:09.102 line:92%
turning around, too, 'cause...

00:01:09.102 --> 00:01:11.671
Well, we were first
all blown away that she was 13.

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, when you turn around
and you even noticed it,

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:16.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
you can tell she's young
but not that young.

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
But still, even if we thought
she was like 16,

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:21.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
we thought, "God,
your voice is so lived in."

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:23.283 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When she said she was 13,
I believe you

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
got out of your chair
and went and walked around.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:28.221 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I was -- 'Cause then
you picture yourself at 13.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:31.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And you're like, "What?"

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.592 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
I -- What?
-Yeah.

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
I still was, like,
braces, acne, glasses.

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was a lot going on,
like, and she's...

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:41.901
She's beautiful, as well.
-Is it against the rules --

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:44.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do they tell you
never get out of your chair?

00:01:44.571 --> 00:01:45.438 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Is that a big thing?

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:48.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm gonna get fined
a lot of money.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:50.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is it like
an airplane situation

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:51.177 size:88% position:44%
where you're not allowed
to get up or anything?

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:55.181 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, I think they love
when I get up and hit Blake.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.449 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:57.684 line:92%
I think they welcome that.

00:01:57.684 --> 00:01:59.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You are going on tour
in January.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And you're going on tour

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:03.189 line:92%
with last year's winner, right?

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Brynn Cartelli
and Kelsea Ballerini.

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's fantastic.
She's wonderful.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:07.327 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I love having her here.

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Whole Lotta Woman --
that's like the tour, man.

00:02:08.995 --> 00:02:11.164 size:84% position:42%
There's a lot of women.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:11.164 --> 00:02:14.701
-And she's 15.
-Yeah, yeah, she just turned --

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:15.502 line:92%
She was 14 on the season.

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:18.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
Adam was actually like,
"Can 13-year-olds audition?"

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:19.639 size:78% position:39% line:92%
We were like, "What?"

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah, it's incredible.
And Brynn is --

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's cool about
our tour because --

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:24.711 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was kind of nervous
'cause I'm like,

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:26.012
"Whoa, that's a lot of females,"
but then it was like,

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
we bring something
so different to the stage.

00:02:27.914 --> 00:02:29.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
-And how our production is

00:02:29.182 --> 00:02:30.950 align:start size:94% position:6%
and how we're
gonna see that through.

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.286 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's so different.
And it's just -- I don't know.

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:34.888
I think you get to an age, too,
where you love

00:02:34.888 --> 00:02:36.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
just hanging out with people
you love.

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:37.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
You want to work
with people you love.

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:39.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And she's --
-Which is why I'm here, Seth.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:40.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, thank you.
-I love you.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:45.231
-So, here's Brynn hanging out
with your daughter, River.

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:47.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-And looks like --

00:02:47.033 --> 00:02:48.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
River's getting it
pretty good there.

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:49.936 line:92%
That's like a mini concert.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She --
Well -- [ Chuckles ]

00:02:51.571 --> 00:02:54.374 align:start size:94% position:6%
Until she told Brynn,
"Shh. It's River's turn.

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:55.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Oh, really?

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:58.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then she serenaded Brynn.
-Oh, wow.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.946 align:start size:94% position:6%
So River
has a lot of confidence.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.415 align:start size:94% position:6%
-She has a lot
of confidence issues. No.

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
No, she's just really bold,
and she loves people.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:08.488 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Brynn
was laughing so hard at that.

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:10.557 line:92%
-And your son's name is...?

00:03:10.557 --> 00:03:12.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Remy.
And he's drumming in the car.

00:03:12.959 --> 00:03:14.594 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's great.
And then, uh --

00:03:14.594 --> 00:03:16.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then there's Henry.
-Henry your dog, yes.

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:17.664 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:19.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Who can't see.
His hair.

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.201 align:start size:94% position:6%
I couldn't
get him a haircut yet.

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:22.835
-Do you --
When you go on tour in January,

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.537 align:start size:94% position:6%
will the kids come with you?
-Yes.

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:27.073
I mean, all four
usually come out at some point,

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.242 size:88% position:44%
but the two younger ones
are pretty much with me.

00:03:29.242 --> 00:03:32.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
They're in school now,
but it's like a weekend thing,

00:03:32.779 --> 00:03:34.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
so, yeah,
they'll probably come out.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
And our 11-year-old
goes on stage sometimes.

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:37.951
-What's that?
-Our 11-year-old goes on stage.

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.953 size:81% position:41%
Seth has been on stage
on one tour with me.

00:03:39.953 --> 00:03:42.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And does he just wander on,
or is it planned?

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:44.624 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's so funny.

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:46.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
He goes and like
high-fives the ladies,

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:49.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he's like, "They love me."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:49.629 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's, like, ama--

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:51.798 align:start size:94% position:6%
None of our kids
suffer from confidence --

00:03:51.798 --> 00:03:54.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
It comes honestly.
-Yeah, exactly.

00:03:54.033 --> 00:03:56.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you introduce him
when he comes out on stage?

00:03:56.469 --> 00:03:57.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
No, he came out --

00:03:57.637 --> 00:03:59.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, it's funny
'cause we started with

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:00.406 size:81% position:41% line:92%
my background singers.

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
They were like,
"Yeah, you can stand with us."

00:04:01.774 --> 00:04:03.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he like,
after the one time was like,

00:04:03.876 --> 00:04:06.980
"So what song am I singing next?
Can I go out on the team?"

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:10.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's hilari--
But he's actually really good.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:11.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's fantastic.
-Yeah, yeah.

